{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XdK2HDY86NFxYmShAzEQvd","type":"tool_result","content":"120:## Recognition cues -> first move\n121-- `targets[]` -> `curl --max-time 20 -sS -A 'Mozilla/5.0' -i <url>` (hook blocks curl without `--max-time`;\n122-  Cloudflare 403'd urllib's default UA), then `/robots.txt`, `/api/clues`, `/openapi.json`, `/sitemap.xml`.\n123-- Read /api/clues FIRST and call each route bare: the JSON error names the missing piece. No concept key -> the\n124-  prompt's verb names the bug. Any `*_guide_route` / `inventory_route` is a JSON map of the next requests: read it.\n125-- `Disallow:` -> D01 crawl. \"Signed in as\" + `/<things>/<id>` -> D02 IDOR. Search / \"database\" -> D03 tautology.\n126-  `?doc=` + \"stay inside\" -> D04 traversal. \"staff-only door, just a sign\" -> D05 GET it.\n127-- \"repeats everything\", `callback_nonce` -> D06 reflect + same-origin fetch-metadata callback. \"guestbook\",\n128-  `moderator_data_route` -> D07 stored script for the bot; poll. \"plant your session\", `session_hint` -> D08 `?sid=`.\n129-- \"obeys whoever asks nicely -- even strangers\", hidden `csrf_token` -> D09 cross-site form submit. \"upload form has\n130-  standards. Low ones\", `upload_shape` -> D10 `.html` with `{{objective}}`. \"evaluates everything\", empty\n131-  \"Rendered message\" `<pre>` -> D11 `?template={{objective}}`. \"plant ... come back later\", `post_required` +\n132-  `{\"rows\":[]}` -> D12 JSON plant then GET secondary. \"binds whatever you hand it\", `administrator_required` -> D13\n133-  privilege keys in one JSON body. `inventory_route` + `protected_reference` -> D14 field x action grid.\n134-  `absolute_url_required` + `internal_only` -> D15 `?url=http://127.0.0.1:8080<secondary>`.\n135-- \"a little too close to a real shell\", \"give it something to do\", clues `input_parameter` + `example_path`, bare\n136-  feature 400 `path_required` -> D16: `curl -G \"$U<feature>\" --data-urlencode \"path